                            <comment id="328667" author="adilger" created="Wed, 9 Mar 2022 22:08:10 +0000">&lt;p&gt;There likely also needs to be a "&lt;tt&gt;dmidecode&lt;/tt&gt;" package installed on some of the test nodes/images to solve this completely, but it is worthwhile to fix the actual test cases first if this isn't too disruptive.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="502855" author="adilger" created="Mon, 5 Oct 2026 21:06:25 +0000">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="error"&gt;&amp;#91;Claude&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; has not failed since 2021-12-01, most recent failure was &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/4c203f3a-8cc4-4cea-b56e-a9d46c8222ec" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/4c203f3a-8cc4-4cea-b56e-a9d46c8222ec&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
